---
title: "Overlays"
---

Overlays are used for displaying messages over the top of the grid.
There are built-in overlays and custom overlays.

## Loading overlay

{% metaTag tags=["showLoadingOverlay"] /%}

When initial data or column definitions are pending, the grid automatically displays the loading overlay until both `rowData` and `columnDefs` are supplied with non-null values.
The loading overlay takes precedence over the other overlays.

{% gridExampleRunner title="Loading overlay" name="loading-overlay"  exampleHeight=350 /%}

Manual control is available by setting the `loading` grid option to `true` or `false`.
Setting it to `true` force displays the loading overlay, while setting it to `false` hides the loading overlay and suppresses its automatic behaviour; other overlays, such as the no-rows overlay, can still appear when their own conditions are met.
Loading overlay can be completely disabled by setting either `loadingOverlayComponent = false` or `components.agLoadingOverlay = false` in the grid options.

{% apiDocumentation source="grid-options/properties.json" section="overlays" names=["loading"] /%}

### Custom Loading Overlay

The loading overlay can be customised via the grid properties `loadingOverlayComponent` and `loadingOverlayComponentParams`.
It is also possible to define `agLoadingOverlay` in the [`components` map](./components) to provide a custom loading overlay component as well.

{% apiDocumentation source="grid-options/properties.json" section="overlays" names=["loadingOverlayComponent", "loadingOverlayComponentParams", "activeOverlayParams"] /%}

{% if isFramework("javascript", "angular") %}
Implement this interface to provide a custom overlay when data is being loaded.
{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("vue") %}
Any valid Vue component can be a loading overlay component, however it is also possible to implement the following optional methods:
{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("angular") %}
{% interfaceDocumentation interfaceName="ILoadingOverlayAngularComp" config={"asCode":true } /%}
{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("javascript") %}
{% interfaceDocumentation interfaceName="ILoadingOverlayComp" config={"asCode":true } /%}
{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("vue") %}
